From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 03 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] FreeChat: invite codes for the freechat command

Local-only routes under /_freechat/admin/ issue, list and revoke
database registration tokens limited in uses and time. Caddy does not
proxy them, and they only answer with FREECHAT_ADMIN_SECRET, compared
in constant time; without it set they refuse everything. The token of
the configuration file is neither listed nor revocable there.
